{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9000_place", "source_sha256": "798fa88035fbd098079bf0cf46ed99f59cd42ff30ee10d8ddc508dcba3f753e1", "ja": "駐車場", "zh": "停车场", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9001_p", "source_sha256": "55afcb62e8009771b65af022ebb9e543a2637b1c153f775d16e7c5df36a79a8e", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア撮影の\n休憩中。麗花のテーマは『HIP POPレディ』だ）", "zh": "（这是偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真拍摄休息时间。丽花的主题是“HIP POP淑女”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9002_p", "source_sha256": "f233da2c92ae54c9cd837588262b3e4d191bd6566a087b206ff8de8720096be5", "ja": "麗花、お疲れさま。\nクールでカッコよくて、バッチリ決まってたよ！", "zh": "丽花，辛苦了。\n又酷又帅，完全展现出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9003_048rei", "source_sha256": "95d0a7da521c46d82e624ba8b546c874264465116f6fbd124eb61bb6621b92fb", "ja": "ありがとうございます。ラッパーの女性って、山の\n一番上にある岩みたいに、ドーンってしてますよね！", "zh": "谢谢。女说唱歌手就像山顶上的岩石一样，气势磅礴地矗立着呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9004_p", "source_sha256": "391877553415a2540cad11a0ae8c440cedc76b027ef306e9e082979bf0017712", "ja": "岩か……。たしかに、\n何があっても動じないところは似てるかもな。", "zh": "岩石啊……确实，\n无论发生什么都毫不动摇这点，可能挺像的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9005_048rei", "source_sha256": "6053a3c3df81fd43160a864620fe5e162be5b8bcf41386e9aa6c1f79591810a3", "ja": "じゃあ、ラッパーの女性も、ぽかぽかなんですね♪\n晴れた日の岩も、触るとぽかぽかで温かいんですから。", "zh": "那么，女说唱歌手也是暖烘烘的呢♪  \n毕竟，晴天里的岩石摸起来也是暖烘烘的，很温暖嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9006_048rei", "source_sha256": "0088b62fea2f302d1589192bd78ca6e077fc8cecd50870ff7cce6f6217c7a087", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、かっこいいラッパーと\nぽかぽかなラッパーだったら、どっちが好きですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生更喜欢\n帅气的说唱歌手，还是暖烘烘的说唱歌手呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9007", "source_sha256": "fa44bcb452a342b64ba61f78b82faeacb36ee4616adfc6d642860ab4f21ebbc6", "ja": "かっこいいラッパー", "zh": "帅气的说唱歌手", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9008", "source_sha256": "6e64c4604ac709e2cc33f4d8bc46e02b8629a663afba9c1e83d8173f1620d819", "ja": "ぽかぽかなラッパー", "zh": "暖洋洋的说唱歌手", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9200_p", "source_sha256": "3d5ad0d25991bf6aa716e031ea032e9a40bce7399b94c448ba20b67fdbadac4c", "ja": "かっこいいラッパーかな。クールで力強さもあって、\n自分を貫いてるところが魅力的だと思うんだ。", "zh": "帅气的说唱歌手吧。既沉着酷炫又充满力量，\n而且能够贯彻自己的风格，我觉得这点很有魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9201_048rei", "source_sha256": "003b6a4325b22f1c493ac646bcb6564685264cc02c57515921bd783ada5cb1c7", "ja": "わぁ～、そうですね！　山の空気みたいに冷たくて、\nでも、とっても澄んでて……キレイですよね。", "zh": "哇～，确实是这样！就像山间的空气一样清冷，\n但又格外澄澈……很美呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9202_048rei", "source_sha256": "541df5009227f210bcae977345de9970fdc1d22550756d552ee27c6a906a83cf", "ja": "それじゃあ後半は、クールでキリッとしたラッパーで\nドドーンと決めちゃいますね♪", "zh": "那么后半段就用又酷又干练的说唱歌手风格，一口气帅气地完成吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9300_p", "source_sha256": "3d5ad0d25991bf6aa716e031ea032e9a40bce7399b94c448ba20b67fdbadac4c", "ja": "かっこいいラッパーかな。クールで力強さもあって、\n自分を貫いてるところが魅力的だと思うんだ。", "zh": "帅气的说唱歌手吧。既沉着酷炫又充满力量，\n而且能够贯彻自己的风格，我觉得这点很有魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9301_048rei", "source_sha256": "d93bfd83aef48e9e8d55f61544a29b8940d4eac95acbf51accb2878be6b0fc72", "ja": "うんうん、素敵ですよね～。どっしりしてて、ビュー\nビュー風が吹いてもびくともしないって感じで……。", "zh": "嗯嗯，真的很棒呢～。沉稳厚重，感觉\n狂风呼呼地吹也纹丝不动呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9302_048rei", "source_sha256": "b509289982d618439a33ba1830625f0d57fc2c19ae53cdbfb307cf85e2c99e1e", "ja": "ますますラッパーの人が岩に見えてきました♪\n後半の撮影は……私も頑丈な岩になろう思います！", "zh": "越来越觉得那位说唱歌手像一块岩石了呢♪\n后半段的拍摄……我也要变成坚固的岩石！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9500_p", "source_sha256": "a84d4602af028991c168da27d1923da42b9110ed8be93d5e06e2b8fae751798a", "ja": "ぽかぽかなラッパーかな。一見かっこいいけど、\n実はあたたかくて優しい人って、素敵だと思うんだ。", "zh": "暖洋洋的说唱歌手吧。乍看很帅气，\n但实际上温暖又温柔的人，我觉得挺棒的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9501_048rei", "source_sha256": "c770262e9f8e09305b3a7823fb164b565790a75ea6f2f38e2b39b5f2e20a8073", "ja": "たしかに、いいですよね～！\nとっても普通な答え、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "确实，很不错呢～！谢谢您给出了非常普通的回答♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9502_048rei", "source_sha256": "209045f1a1185009d77eba61e90033c2e5c638963d7ab62de0d9fa1742adfd5b", "ja": "周りを温かくできるような、ぽかぽかラッパーを\n一緒に目指しましょう！　ね、ぽかデューサーさん♪", "zh": "能温暖身边所有人的、暖洋洋的说唱歌手，\n我们一起以此为目标吧！对吧，暖呼呼制作人先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9600_p", "source_sha256": "a84d4602af028991c168da27d1923da42b9110ed8be93d5e06e2b8fae751798a", "ja": "ぽかぽかなラッパーかな。一見かっこいいけど、\n実はあたたかくて優しい人って、素敵だと思うんだ。", "zh": "暖洋洋的说唱歌手吧。乍看很帅气，\n但实际上温暖又温柔的人，我觉得挺棒的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9601_048rei", "source_sha256": "2d0bb0de689fc95fb64e8d9bf03966db82fbf5101bd4975887924faba96e5971", "ja": "ふむふむ、なるほどなるほど～。ぽかぽかしてる人って\nおひさまの下のベンチみたいで、ホッとしますもんね。", "zh": "嗯嗯，原来如此原来如此～。温暖的人就像阳光下的长椅一样，让人感到安心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_9602_048rei", "source_sha256": "b72df23844e9ad59184f78c192fb5a540b4f3b034840e725ce081fa09313202f", "ja": "座ると、だんだん眠く……ふわぁ～。あれあれ？\n想像したら、なんだか眠くなってきちゃいました……。", "zh": "坐上去之后，就会渐渐变得想睡……呼啊～。咦？\n光是想象了一下，不知怎么就困起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
